
>> countries := સૂચિ નવું
	~ ['Switzerland']
	~ ['Italy']
	~ ['Germany'].

>> foods := સૂચિ નવું
	~ ['Rösti']
	~ ['Spaghetti']
	~ ['Sauerkraut'].


>> counter := 0.
foods મુજબ: countries, દરેક: { :key :value
	counter સરવાળો: 1.
}.

આઉટપુટ લખો: (['we serve counter dishes'] counter: counter), નવી-લીટી.

>> counter := 42.
['TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'] અક્ષરો ક્રમ-ગોઠવો: { :v
	counter સરવાળો: 0.
}.

આઉટપુટ લખો: (['we sort counter dishes'] counter: counter), નવી-લીટી.


>> counter := 0.
{
	{
		counter સરવાળો: 1.
	} × (3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5).
} × 100.


આઉટપુટ લખો: (['we calculate counter numbers.'] counter: counter), નવી-લીટી.

